✅ 5 New SPOT strategies added:
  - mavourg_alpha_spot: Balanced 30-40 bin SPOT (MavourG style)
  - spot_sniper_elite: Ultra-tight 10-15 bin SPOT (93% WR data)
  - degen_spot_runner: Medium-wide 40-50 bin SPOT (trend rider)
  - yield_farmer_spot: Wide 60-80 bin SPOT (conservative farm)
  - directional_spot_pro: Tilted 70/30 SPOT (directional bias)

✅ Two-sided SPOT deploy unlocked in dlmm.js
✅ Strategy-aware SCREENER prompt
✅ Default strategy: SPOT (was bid_ask)
✅ Executor safety checks for SPOT path

Data source: TrackLP (3,214 positions analysis), MavourG alpha philosophy
